                          "description_en": "The skill group ID associated with the voice channel. In inbound scenarios, the associated skill group ID is determined by the skill group configured in the IVR transfer-to-agent module. In outbound scenarios, the associated skill group ID is the first skill group that the agent signed into",
                          "description_zh": "话务通道关联的技能组ID，呼入场景下，关联的技能组ID由IVR中转人工模块配置的技能组决定，呼出场景下，关联的技能组ID为座席签入的第一个技能组的ID",
